{"id":38360,"imdb":"tt0050634","en":"The Cranes Are Flying","orig":"Летят журавли","ar":"الرافعات تحلق","tag":"The compelling story of a girl's impassioned search for happiness.","ov":"يلتقي فيرونيكا وبوريس في موسكو قبيل اندلاع الحرب العالمية الثانية. وبينما يسيران على ضفاف النهر، يشاهدان طيور الكركي تحلق في السماء، ويتفقان على اللقاء قبل أن يغادر بوريس للقتال. يتخلف بوريس عن اللقاء وينطلق إلى الجبهة، بينما تنتظره فيرونيكا بصبر، وترسل له رسائل بانتظام. بعد قصف منزلها، تنتقل فيرونيكا للعيش مع عائلة بوريس، برفقة ابن عم له نواياه الخاصة.","rd":"1957-10-12","rt":97,"g":[18,10749,10752],"lang":"ru","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Mosfilm","logo":"/xenuUvcunUNpbaDOYGhWZERaym7.png","c":"SU"}],"countries":["SU"],"langs":["Russian"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"SU","d":"1957-10-12"},{"c":"BR","d":"1958-01-01"},{"c":"FR","d":"1958-06-11"},{"c":"JP","d":"1958-08-26"},{"c":"DE","d":"1958-09-19"},{"c":"FI","d":"1958-09-19"},{"c":"GB","d":"1959-03-18"},{"c":"PT","d":"1974-01-31"},{"c":"PH","d":"1992-09-08"},{"c":"NL","d":"2025-01-09"}],"dir":["Mikhail Kalatozov"],"prod":[],"wri":["Viktor Rozov"],"mus":["Mieczysław Weinberg"],"dop":["Sergei Urusevsky"],"cast":[{"n":"Tatyana Samoylova","ch":"Veronika","p":"/cKnswgxIVaC7CoEQ9yVNPQpRewb.jpg"},{"n":"Aleksey Batalov","ch":"Boris","p":"/6dgzimnivd1abx8Sz1yCMJlcnA3.jpg"},{"n":"Vasili Merkuryev","ch":"Fyodor Ivanovich","p":"/tefCC9tZ0PDdxzhG3oUooBrWZq9.jpg"},{"n":"Aleksandr Shvorin","ch":"Mark","p":"/ckcJ0Ui7OtGL64CO9ihqfILQgmd.jpg"},{"n":"Svetlana Kharitonova","ch":"Irina","p":"/gMURYPtM4GlBjNHvmUNDNHMsBT3.jpg"},{"n":"Konstantin Kadochnikov","ch":"Volodya","p":"/BL0TwvOwUX9Q3tX9jF1Ix9zZiy.jpg"},{"n":"Valentin Zubkov","ch":"Stepan","p":"/67v6mspbiygZxxECMEm80nzUC1m.jpg"},{"n":"Antonina Bogdanova","ch":"Grandmother","p":"/di5JNtP6qgNUYOD1CgnmaRSAdmp.jpg"},{"n":"Boris Kokovkin","ch":"Chernov","p":"/mUZH91L8Kw612yKMRcW1ffAVtwA.jpg"},{"n":"Ekaterina Kupriyanova","ch":"Anna Mikhaylovna","p":"/o7036P1a7h4IWY321q1raAN6bA6.jpg"},{"n":"Valent